<!--
  The widget's words. Generated once from the lists that used to live in
  WidgetCopy.kt; edit this file directly from now on.

  The headline is the fact and stays plain. The quip under it is the joke,
  and its pools are the part meant to grow: add lines to any
  widget_quips_* array and the widget picks them up with no code change.
  Keep a line short enough to fit two lines on the narrow widget
  (WidgetQuipsTest measures it), and keep night lines free of sunshine.
-->
